        "original_paragraph": {
            "Materials and Methods": "Surface plasmon resonance (SPR) experiments were carried out in vitro in order to examine the direct interaction of compounds 10 and 12 with the recombinant SETDB1/ESET protein. SPR kinetic data showed that compounds 10 and 12 could bind to the SETDB1/ESET protein with Kd values of 3.26 ± 1.71 and 0.232 ± 0.146 μM, respectively (Table 3)."
        },
